{"meta":{"id":"access-modifier","category":"it/syntax/python/class","title":"접근 관례 · @property · Python","subtitle":"(PYTHON)","summary":"_ / __ 이름 관례(키워드 없음), @property getter · setter","tags":["python","f-class","f-access"],"color":"violet","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-violet","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-violet-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-violet-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-violet-50 text-violet-700 border border-violet-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></span>PYTHON</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">접근 관례 · @property · Python</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-violet-50/70 border border-violet-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-violet-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> _ / __ 이름 관례(키워드 없음), @property getter · setter</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">접근 관례 (키워드 없음)</h2></div><div class=\"border border-stone-200 rounded-2xl overflow-x-auto bg-white\"><table class=\"w-full text-left text-xs sm:text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"bg-stone-50 border-b border-stone-200 text-stone-600 font-semibold\"><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">표기</th><th class=\"py-2 px-3 whitespace-nowrap\">의미</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-100\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>name</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">공개</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>_name</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">내부용 관례 (protected 처럼 사용, 접근은 가능)</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-violet-50/40\"><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top font-semibold text-stone-900 whitespace-nowrap\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>__name</code></td><td class=\"py-2 px-3 align-top text-stone-600\">이름 변경(name mangling) → _Class__name, private 처럼 사용</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-violet-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">@property — get / set</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">python</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">class Account:\r\n    def __init__(self) -&gt; None:\r\n        self.__balance = 0\r\n\r\n    @property\r\n    def balance(self) -&gt; int:          # 읽기 전용 속성 (readonly)\r\n        return self.__balance\r\n\r\n    @balance.setter\r\n    def balance(self, v: int) -&gt; None:\r\n        if v &lt; 0: raise ValueError(&quot;음수 불가&quot;)\r\n        self.__balance = v\r\n\r\nacc = Account()\r\nacc.balance = 100\r\nacc._Account__balance   # 접근 가능 — 강제가 아닌 관례</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 접근 제한자, JavaScript › #private · get/set</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/python/class/access-modifier","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"python","title":"PYTHON","path":"it/syntax/python"},{"id":"class","title":"클래스","path":"it/syntax/python/class"}],"hasImage":false}